    "media:imagetext": "memory is one which you will long cherish. Single\npassengers, $15.00. Special rates for parties.\nBIMINI-NASSAU AIR LINES-Regular service\nto the Bahama Island ports. Over the Gulf Stream\nto Bimini in 50 minutes and from thence to Nassau\nin another 90 minutes.\nNothing can surpass the\nbeauty of these coral islands as viewed from the air.\nThey set like gems in a sea of azure blue and never\nuntil the advent of aviation have even their inhabi-\ntants realized their glorious colorings. Your esthetic\nself will be transported to higher realms than even\nthe staunchest airplane could carry you.\nTO CUBA BY AIR-Over the Keys of southern\nFlorida. A panoramic survey of the gigantic cngin-\neering\nfeat accomplished by the Florida East Coast\nRailway. Then by way of Key West to Morro Castle\n-the Bastile of America's Paris-Havana.\nPASSPORTS—For passengers who wish to em-\nbark for points abroad, a short notice will be neces-\nsary in order that they may obtain passports, a\nmatter which will be facilitated by the Passenger\nDepartment, every effort being made to help pas-\nsengers\nin obtaining the required papers. Delays\nare rarely experienced.\nIn conclusion let us say that a trip in the air\nunder the conditions of safety and comfort provided\nby Aero Limited is an attraction difficult to resist.\nTravel through the air is smooth and steady and\ndevoid of any obstacle or restriction such as no\nperfect roadway or water route can boast. Ask\nanyone who has made a trip.\nAERO LIMITED\nFirst Aerial Passenger Routes in America\nNew York, N. Y. Miami, Fla.\nNassau, B. I.\n20 W. 34th St.\nElser's\nPier\nHotel Lucerne\nC. Nicholas Reinhardt, G. P. A.\nR. T. Bellchambers, P. A.\nTHE HEFTY PRESS, MIAMI",
